  "body": "We are excited to announce the first release of bitchat-tui, a modern terminal client for BitChat.\r\n\r\nbitchat-tui allows you to engage in secure, anonymous, and peer-to-peer messaging directly over Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE). Communicate completely off-grid with end-to-end encryption, public channels, and direct messaging, all from a clean and intuitive terminal interface. No internet or central servers are required.\r\n\r\nGet started easily with the universal install script:\r\n\r\n`curl -sSfL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vaibhav-mattoo/bitchat-tui/main/install.sh | sh`\r\n\r\nThe client is also available on the AUR, Homebrew, and Crates.io. For more information and to contribute, please visit the project repository.",
